    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.jump\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nConsider exporting information about status of module. Basically, exported variant of [`H.jumping`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/632f9d33ebbadadb8f15629983de8815f8d37a48/lua/mini/jump.lua#L223) and [`H.cache`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/632f9d33ebbadadb8f15629983de8815f8d37a48/lua/mini/jump.lua#L220). This might be useful for creating custom mappings which depend on current module status (see #26).",
